<title>HUNGARY: Hungary's BUX ends officially at 5,991.32 points.</title>
<headline>Hungary's BUX ends officially at 5,991.32 points.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The BUX index of the Budapest Stock Exchange finished officially at a new record high of 5,991.32 points, up 117.73 points, unchanged from the preliminary figures.</p>
<p>Spot share turnover totalled 2.34 billion forints.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
